msgid "**Admin Accounts from the Administrator Group:** [`files/php/rbac/reconcile_admin_users.php`](./files/php/rbac/reconcile_admin_users.php) activates the Magento admin accounts of the `administrator` group members and deactivates every other admin account; the platform administrator stays untouched. [`tasks/04_rbac.yml`](./tasks/04_rbac.yml) registers it as an RBAC hook of [sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync](../sys-ctl-mtn-rbac-sync/), which runs it in the PHP container at every deploy and on its timer."
