msgid "**Admin Console Roles:** The groups ``user-manager``, ``auditor`` and ``impersonator`` under ``/roles/web-app-keycloak`` grant user management, read-only auditing and impersonation in the application realm. Each role lists its ``realm-management`` client roles under ``realm_management`` in `rbac.yml <meta/rbac.yml>`__. ``realm-admin`` stays with the local bootstrap account. A user manager can change group memberships, which includes every application role group, so grant ``user-manager`` only to people trusted with every application role."
