msgid "**Directory delegations off against old ganesha:** When the server runs nfs-ganesha older than 9.11, every client and the controller set the kernel's `nfsv4` parameter `directory_delegations` to `N`, at runtime and in `/etc/modprobe.d`. The parameter is kernel-wide, so on a lab whose nodes share one kernel it covers every NFS mount of that host until the module reloads."
msgstr ""

msgid "**Directory delegations off against old ganesha:** When the server runs nfs-ganesha older than 9.11, every client and the controller set the kernel’s ``nfsv4`` parameter ``directory_delegations`` to ``N``, at runtime and in ``/etc/modprobe.d``. The parameter is kernel-wide, so on a lab whose nodes share one kernel it covers every NFS mount of that host until the module reloads."
