msgid "**Roles From Keycloak Groups:** Every OIDC login sets the Mastodon role from the ``groups`` claim. The ``administrator`` role group grants ``Admin``, the ``moderator`` role group grants ``Moderator``, and an account outside both loses either role. Accounts that hold ``Owner`` or a role created in Mastodon stay untouched, so the platform administrator keeps ``Owner``."
