msgstr ""

# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any
# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any `gh gpg-key`
# Subcommand. `add` Kalıcı bir taahhüt kimliğini imzalayan bir saldırgan,
# imzalanmış taahhütlerde operatörden sorumlu tutabilir; `delete` Operatörleri
# imzalanmış politikalardan kilitleyebilir; `list` Anahtar işaret envanteri
# sızdırır. Out-of-band anahtar yönetimi sadece.
msgid "Any `gh gpg-key` subcommand. `add` installs a persistent commit-signing identity an attacker could use to impersonate the operator on signed commits; `delete` can lock the operator out of signed-commit policies; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr ""

# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any
# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any `gh secret`
# Subcommand. `set`/ /`remove` operatörün kimliğinin altındaki CI sırları;
# `list` Gizli isimler, tam aynı risk sınıfı olarak `gh api *
# /actions/secrets*` inkar inkar inkar inkar ("GETs bile gizli isimler").
# Out-of-band sır yönetimi sadece.
msgid "Any `gh secret` subcommand. `set`/`remove` mutate CI secrets under the operator's identity; `list` leaks secret names, the exact same risk class as the `gh api * /actions/secrets*` deny (\"Even GETs leak secret names\"). Out-of-band secret management only."
msgstr ""

# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any
# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any `gh ssh-key`
# Subcommand. `add` Geri dönen kalıcı bir auth backdoor, geri çekilmeye kadar
# kabuklu itme erişimi veriyor; `delete` Operatörü kilitleyebilir; `list`
# Anahtar işaret envanteri sızdırır. Out-of-band anahtar yönetimi sadece.
msgid "Any `gh ssh-key` subcommand. `add` is a persistent auth backdoor giving shell-equivalent push access until revoked; `delete` can lock the operator out; `list` leaks the key-fingerprint inventory. Out-of-band key management only."
msgstr ""

# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any
# Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any Any `gh variable`
