msgstr "Gömülü modda (``shared: false``) Bir tüketicinin seti bir depolama alanı alır - sadece SeaweedFS UI olmadan veya yayınlanan portlar olmadan konteyner. gömülü S3 Dinleyici hiçbir doğrulama yapmaz, bu yüzden MUST tüketicinin izole form ağı ile sınırlı kalır."

msgid "In embedded mode (``shared: false``) a consumer’s compose stack receives a storage-only SeaweedFS container without UI or published ports. The embedded S3 listener starts without identities and accepts unauthenticated requests until the background ``s3.configure`` grant at startup registers the consumer identity; from then on it authenticates against that identity. Embedded buckets carry no ``DenyAnonymousRead`` statement because the listener publishes no port, so the container MUST stay confined to the consumer’s isolated compose network."
