msgid "The `deploy` job of `call-test-deploy.yml` holds a job-level group keyed on every matrix axis: `mode`, `tor`, `distro`, `filesystem`, `apps` and `variant`. One deployment runs at a time across all branches; an identical one from another run queues behind it (`queue: max`), and a cancel removes a queued one."
