msgid "The target is what the instructions call \"a managed server\". It is deliberately bare: everything else it ends up with arrives through the deploy under test. The harness owns no part of it; the stack resets it before every deploy round, compose and swarm alike, and this test only claims and uses it. Every other host of a swarm deploy skips, because one reset serves one replay."
