msgid "`native` is the Internal directory password. Under SSO it only steers Roundcube: `oauth_login_redirect` sends the sign-in straight to Keycloak while `native` is off and shows the password form next to the SSO button while it is on. Without SSO the Internal directory is the only sign-in, so `tasks/00_core.yml` refuses `native: false` there."
msgstr ""

msgid "`native` is the local email and password sign-in Greenlight offers whenever `OPENID_CONNECT_ISSUER` is unset. Greenlight has no switch of its own for it, so [tasks/04_login_methods.yml](./tasks/04_login_methods.yml) refuses an inventory that sets `native` equal to `sso`."
